README.md-256-| 13 | `gate_ppc.sh` | PowerPC single conversion — 72 rows on the macppc probe path: `frsp` under all four modes (each verified guest-visible through `mffs`), the ISA denormalization band, NaN payload/sign transport, sticky `VXSNAN`, all eight float update forms asserting value *and* base-register update, and three pins where this fork deliberately differs from the letter |
